 "method": "Categorical soft-label index master at 16x (4096): one-hot mask of every native index blurred at 4x and texel-centred bilinear to 16x; crisp contours everywhere (sigma 0.38 texel, power 5); where the native page dithers between indices that share the class under every renderable static CLUT of the page and are close in colour (RGB distance <= 56) under at least 75 % of them, only those indices are blended (sigma 1.0 texel), so dither becomes the intended mixed tone while edges between distinct tones stay crisp, top-3 labels kept; texels whose native index lost its own centre keep a rounded-square core of that index (superellipse p=6, full weight to the mid-edges), native index forced at every texel centre. Palette-independent armour material logD at 8x: relief from the reference-CLUT luminance (sigma 0.9 texel, light from the upper left), light groove AO at luminance edges, luminance detail from the Stage 1 JuggernautXL navy_armour + gunmetal_worn tileable swatches (raw images where they exist, centre 60%, overlapping Hann-windowed random patches, horizontal flips only: no tiling seam, no repeat; high-pass sigma 48 px, band-limited sigma 1.5 px at 2048), low-frequency grime; zero-mean per native index. No GP0 polygons exist for stage 4, so there is no per-unit vector outline or seam layer (the Stage 1 t7/w4 vector step); per-unit cutting waits for AQ-03 draw UVs.",
 "render_formula": "w = top-3 soft labels; base = sum_k w_k P[l_k] over labels of the dominant class; rgb = base * exp(logD) (opaque classes); class = class(P[l_0]); class 0 = raw black; runtime = majority-class box-down of the 4096 render + native class stamped at floor((i+0.5)*scale)",
 "class_validation": {
  "file": "native-class-validation.json",
  "total_mismatches": 0,
  "exports": 6,
  "convention": "class at pixel floor((i+0.5)*scale) of every native texel == class(CLUT[native index]); class 0 = raw 0x0000, 255 = STP, 127 = opaque"
